10
00:00:23,880 --> 00:00:26,620
The judges of the underworld condemned Inanna.

11
00:00:26,620 --> 00:00:29,480
Her lifeless body was suspended,

12
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,520
while her servant Ninshubur sought help in

13
00:00:32,520 --> 00:00:33,515
